Step 3: Enable Firebase Services
Firebase Authentication:

Go to Build $\rightarrow$ Authentication $\rightarrow$ Get Started.
Enable Email/Password and Google sign-in providers.
Cloud Firestore Database:

Go to Build $\rightarrow$ Firestore Database $\rightarrow$ Create Database.
Select production mode and choose your server location (e.g. europe-west3 or us-central).
Firebase Storage:

Go to Build $\rightarrow$ Storage $\rightarrow$ Get Started.
Used for storing tester screenshot proofs and mobile app APKs.
Step 4: Secure Admin Email Protection (Secret Manager)
To safeguard support@databounty.sampidia.com from being exposed in public client bundles or hardcoded in repositories:

Store ADMIN_EMAIL in Google Cloud Secret Manager or Vercel Environment Variables:
bash
# In Google Cloud CLI (Optional for Firebase Functions)
gcloud secrets create ADMIN_EMAIL --replication-policy="automatic"
echo -n "support@databounty.sampidia.com" | gcloud secrets versions add ADMIN_EMAIL --data-file=-
In Next.js API Routes (like 

route.ts
), read process.env.ADMIN_EMAIL server-side only.
Step 5: Firestore Security Rules Setup
Go to Firestore $\rightarrow$ Rules tab and deploy the following security policy:

javascript
rules_version = '2';
service cloud.firestore {
  match /databases/{database}/documents {
    
    // User Profile Rules
    match /users/{userId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow write: if request.auth != null && request.auth.uid == userId;
    }
    
    // Bounty Tasks Rules
    match /bounties/{taskId} {
      allow read: if true; // Public feed matching
      allow create: if request.auth != null && request.resource.data.creatorFeePaid > 0;
      allow update, delete: if request.auth != null && resource.data.creatorId == request.auth.uid;
    }
    
    // Submissions Rules
    match /submissions/{subId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null;
      allow create: if request.auth != null && request.resource.data.userId == request.auth.uid;
      allow update: if request.auth != null && (resource.data.userId == request.auth.uid || resource.data.creatorId == request.auth.uid);
    }
    
    // Withdrawal Requests (Admin restricted)
    match /withdrawals/{wdId} {
      allow read: if request.auth != null && (resource.data.userId == request.auth.uid || request.auth.token.admin == true);
      allow create: if request.auth != null && request.resource.data.amount >= 100;
      allow update: if request.auth != null && request.auth.token.admin == true;
    }
  }
}
